*** Test Cases ***
### SA
# CB010513-C_1_IWK of PRB pooling with slide aware scheduler_CB009084_2_slices_SA
# [1] TC_CB010513_C_1_SA_IWK_PRB_pooling_with_slice_aware_scheduler
[1] CB010513-C_1_IWK of PRB pooling with slide aware scheduler_CB009084_2_slices_SA
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the configuration ${CB010513_C_1_SA}
    ...     Actions:        it performs the call setup for multi-ues on different cells for testing interworking with slices aware scheduler
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        calls on slices for multi ues and PRB pooling are passed

    TC_CB010513_C_1_SA                          param=${CB010513_C_1_SA}
    ...                                         test_name=TC_CB010513_C_1_SA
    ...                                         vendor_custom=${VENDOR_CUSTOM_1}
    ...                                         dict_ues=${dict_settings_all_ues}
    ...                                         is_capture=${CAPTURE_OFF}
    [Teardown]                                  Setup.Test Teardown     # must be called whether the test is OK or not: Scout data are mandatory
